# Copy to ~/.config/caddy/netcup.env on the mini PC (chmod 600). Not in git.
#
# NOT your netcup website login (email/password for the shop/CCP browser).
#
# Caddy uses the Legacy DNS API. In CCP: Stammdaten / Master data → API:
#   - Legacy API Keys → create key (the NETCUP_API_KEY value)
#   - Legacy API Keys → "Regenerating API Password" once (NETCUP_API_PASSWORD)
#   - Customer number from CCP header (NETCUP_CUSTOMER_NUMBER, digits only)
#
# If your domain shows a "CloudDNS" tab (not only "DNS"), the new "API Keys" block
# is a different system — ask before switching; Legacy DNS + Legacy keys are required here.

NETCUP_CUSTOMER_NUMBER=
NETCUP_API_KEY=
NETCUP_API_PASSWORD=
